Verse 1:
[Ab]Christ [Db]is [Cm]coming! [Ab]Let creation Bid [Eb]her [Ab]groans [Db]andtravail [Eb7]cease;
[Ab]Let [Db]the [Cm]glorious [Ab]proclamation [Eb]Hope [Ab]restore [Db]and faith [Ab/Eb]increase;
